@startuml analytics-pipeline-audit
title Pipeline analytics — points de rupture (audit 2026-06-04)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

package "Client (émission)" {
  [sections /kit\nview_item ✓] as Emit1
  [CTAs\npack_cta_click ✗] as EmitCta
  [(rien)\npage_view ✗] as EmitPv
  [wizard\nbegin_checkout/address_completed/\nadd_payment_info/lead_capture/purchase ✓] as EmitWiz
  [(rien)\ncta_impression/scroll_depth_50 ✗] as EmitEng
}

[POST /api/track\nvalidator (schema)] as Ingest
database "tracking_events_log\n(verbatim, consent granted)" as DB

package "Agrégation (lib/analytics)" {
  [overview.ts\nbounce/topPages\n(lit page_view)] as Q1
  [funnel.ts\nCUMULATIF strict\nengage->cta->checkout->purchase] as Q2
  [cta.ts\n(lit cta_click/cta_impression)] as Q3
  [checkout.ts\n(attend add_shipping_info/view_cart)] as Q4
  [insights matviews] as Q5
}

package "UI /admin/analytics" {
  [Overview] [Funnel] [CTA] [Checkout] [Insights]
}

Emit1 --> Ingest
EmitWiz --> Ingest
EmitCta -[#red]-> Ingest : REJETÉ (unknown_event) AN-03
EmitPv -[#red]-> Ingest : jamais émis AN-01
EmitEng -[#red]-> Ingest : jamais émis AN-02
Ingest --> DB

DB --> Q1
DB --> Q2
DB --> Q3
DB --> Q4
DB --> Q5

Q1 -[#red]-> Overview : bounce=null / topPages=[] (AN-01)
Q2 -[#red]-> Funnel : collapse après view (AN-02) ; purchase ignore generate_lead (AN-06)
Q3 -[#red]-> CTA : vide (cta_*=0) (AN-03)
Q4 -[#red]-> Checkout : view_cart=0 ; address_completed non mappé (AN-04)
Q5 -[#red]-> Insights : matviews non rafraîchies (AN-05)

note bottom
  Root cause = rupture émission/ingestion (events absents/rejetés)
  AMPLIFIÉE par le modèle funnel cumulatif strict.
  Les events présents (begin_checkout 97, purchase 13…) ne sont jamais
  comptés car aucune session ne passe l'étape "engage" (vide).
end note
@enduml
